{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pardon My French Toast is a 3D platformer starring a slice of toast who covers himself in sweet spreads to get fun abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/48cea0aa4ccd0f90cffcc166e10b0540.poster.avif?t=1766069842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/48cea0aa4ccd0f90cffcc166e10b0540.webm?t=1766069842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a dozen abilities, each more amazing than the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STICKY HONEY</strong> - Spread honey on your face to stick to objects and climb walls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWERFUL CHOCOLATE</strong> - Use hardened chocolate to break obstacles</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And much more after this gif!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/9b867b97f4ff7dca4d56d23282925ca6.poster.avif?t=1766069842\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/9b867b97f4ff7dca4d56d23282925ca6.webm?t=1766069842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A piece of cake?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VACATIONS GONE WRONG</strong> - Welcome to the Jam Session Cruise! Lucky you, you just happened to stumble across a ticket for a lovely vacation at sea! At least, until you discover that this boat can barely float!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELICIOUSLY SWEET LEVELS</strong> - Explore dozens of levels and find huge candies to fuel the boat. From fruity cakes to tropical jungles to haunted floating islands (and more!), get bready for some tasty sights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDLY TOASTS EVERYWHERE</strong> - You're not alone on this cruise; lots of other toasts are along for the ride! Get to know them: they\u2019ve all got a good reason for being there. Maybe you can help them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEO-RETRO GAMEPLAY</strong> - Got a taste for platformers? Discover this toast's original moveset: slap, aerial dash, French toast (absorb and spit out liquid!!)... No spoilers, we'll stop the list here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TONS OF COLLECTIBLES</strong> - Like collecting lots of shiny little things? You\u2019re going to loaf it! Reach for the stars with 100% completion!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGES FOR THE BRAVE</strong> - Want to give yourself a slice of hard mode? This cruise has some nice surprises in store! But don't panic, all these challenges are optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now there's just one thing left to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/0c2e08f640e1c1cde93ec202cfbac0e9.poster.avif?t=1766069842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/0c2e08f640e1c1cde93ec202cfbac0e9.webm?t=1766069842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Collect 100 gummy bears","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/7fc028349be3e3e083c8f765baf05e6ddd94f001.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 1500 gummy bears","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/5f3f9422f3bffce1cfd5ff92380298172d83f6aa.jpg"},{"name":"Collect all gummy bears","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/98b27ef260bfd910a1af26f26ad8a57ed602f0ad.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 1 candy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/257305e779de0e9ef9d9753da2e36cb258d7d566.jpg"},{"name":"Collect 20 candies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/5fa1052c5cf8b1f49b065cc30f81fe78eba0c765.jpg"},{"name":"Collect all candies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/88f3729442412c8e5de39f12f877fe6c7a623ad9.jpg"},{"name":"Find 1 recipe","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/713059461c1d7a93185e67b2bbb8ee78570ed5a9.jpg"},{"name":"Find 5 recipes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/5521b352883e35cdf31f4f1220fe35759b05c903.jpg"},{"name":"Find all recipes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/ad39060d899372089a7c6797d2f0f1c70768240a.jpg"},{"name":"Finish the world 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3407360/29778c59156be313ab7e3cc66516762e10ef909d.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3407360?t=1766069842","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/00af09029dd187d014b491aca913122bcace98a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766069842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/cec77afd9672603639fb55404544ddca8cc1fc3c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766069842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/cec77afd9672603639fb55404544ddca8cc1fc3c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766069842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descriptio