NG</strong> - Welcome to the Jam Session Cruise! Lucky you, you just happened to stumble across a ticket for a lovely vacation at sea! At least, until you discover that this boat can barely float!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELICIOUSLY SWEET LEVELS</strong> - Explore dozens of levels and find huge candies to fuel the boat. From fruity cakes to tropical jungles to haunted floating islands (and more!), get bready for some tasty sights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDLY TOASTS EVERYWHERE</strong> - You're not alone on this cruise; lots of other toasts are along for the ride! Get to know them: they\u2019ve all got a good reason for being there. Maybe you can help them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEO-RETRO GAMEPLAY</strong> - Got a taste for platformers? Discover this toast's original moveset: slap, aerial dash, French toast (absorb and spit out liquid!!)... No spoilers, we'll stop the list here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TONS OF COLLECTIBLES</strong> - Like collecting lots of shiny little things? You\u2019re going to loaf it! Reach for the stars with 100% completion!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGES FOR THE BRAVE</strong> - Want to give yourself a slice of hard mode? This cruise has some nice surprises in store! But don't panic, all these challenges are optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now there's just one thing left to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/0c2e08f640e1c1cde93ec202cfbac0e9.poster.avif?t=1766069842\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/0c2e08f640e1c1cde93ec202cfbac0e9.webm?t=1766069842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["ReRolled Studio"],"gen